WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
Welcome to Nabulines Academy.

2
00:00:01.985 --> 00:00:03.831
I'm here to take you from absolute zero to

3
00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:06.351
building real apps — no prior experience

4
00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:06.780
needed.

5
00:00:07.326 --> 00:00:08.789
In this lesson, you're creating your

6
00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:10.530
Claude account and sending your first

7
00:00:10.588 --> 00:00:11.076
message.

8
00:00:11.714 --> 00:00:13.479
Claude is an AI assistant that will help

9
00:00:13.526 --> 00:00:15.639
you build websites and apps, even if

10
00:00:15.674 --> 00:00:17.264
you've never written a line of code.

11
00:00:18.007 --> 00:00:19.528
By the end of this video, you'll be

12
00:00:19.551 --> 00:00:21.107
chatting with Claude and ready to start

13
00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:21.560
building.

14
00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:22.663
Let's go.

15
00:00:22.663 --> 00:00:24.045
First, what is Claude?

16
00:00:24.683 --> 00:00:26.726
Claude is an AI made by a company called

17
00:00:26.796 --> 00:00:27.458
Anthropic.

18
00:00:28.096 --> 00:00:29.977
You type questions or requests to Claude

19
00:00:30.001 --> 00:00:32.729
in plain English, and it responds — kind

20
00:00:32.764 --> 00:00:34.377
of like texting a really smart friend who

21
00:00:34.412 --> 00:00:35.237
knows how to code.

22
00:00:35.782 --> 00:00:38.034
You'll use Claude to design pages, write

23
00:00:38.069 --> 00:00:40.252
code, and solve problems as you learn.

24
00:00:40.798 --> 00:00:41.575
The best part?

25
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.607
You can start completely free.

26
00:00:44.013 --> 00:00:45.650
Claude has a free plan that gives you

27
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.589
enough daily usage to follow along with

28
00:00:47.624 --> 00:00:49.134
the early chapters of this course.

29
00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:51.572
Later, if you want more power or a tool

30
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.650
called Claude Code, you can upgrade to the

31
00:00:53.685 --> 00:00:55.357
Pro plan for twenty dollars a month.

32
00:00:55.577 --> 00:00:57.435
But right now, we're starting at zero

33
00:00:57.493 --> 00:00:57.969
dollars.

34
00:00:58.317 --> 00:00:59.629
Let's create your account.

35
00:00:59.629 --> 00:01:02.125
Open your web browser — that's Chrome,

36
00:01:02.473 --> 00:01:05.817
Safari, Firefox, whatever you use to visit

37
00:01:05.852 --> 00:01:06.525
websites.

38
00:01:07.071 --> 00:01:09.497
In the address bar at the top, type claude

39
00:01:09.544 --> 00:01:11.146
dot ai and press Enter.

40
00:01:11.692 --> 00:01:13.398
You'll land on Claude's homepage.

41
00:01:14.037 --> 00:01:16.057
Look for a button that says Sign Up or Get

42
00:01:16.115 --> 00:01:18.820
Started — it's usually big and obvious,

43
00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:20.492
often in the top right corner.

44
00:01:20.782 --> 00:01:21.247
Click it.

45
00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:23.650
Now Claude will ask how you want to sign

46
00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:23.963
up.

47
00:01:24.602 --> 00:01:26.552
You have three options: sign up with

48
00:01:26.611 --> 00:01:28.967
Google, sign up with your email, or sign

49
00:01:29.002 --> 00:01:29.942
up with a phone number.

50
00:01:30.349 --> 00:01:32.125
Pick whichever is easiest for you.

51
00:01:32.671 --> 00:01:34.830
If you choose Google, you'll see a pop-up

52
00:01:34.888 --> 00:01:36.583
asking you to select your Google account —

53
00:01:36.804 --> 00:01:38.940
click the one you want to use, and Claude

54
00:01:38.963 --> 00:01:40.821
will create your account automatically.

55
00:01:41.459 --> 00:01:43.190
If you choose email, type your email

56
00:01:43.224 --> 00:01:45.036
address, then check your inbox for a

57
00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:46.011
confirmation code.

58
00:01:46.556 --> 00:01:48.774
Copy that code, paste it into the box on

59
00:01:48.832 --> 00:01:50.481
Claude's page, and you're in.

60
00:01:51.224 --> 00:01:52.930
If you use a phone number, Claude will

61
00:01:52.965 --> 00:01:55.345
text you a code — type it in the same way.

62
00:01:55.983 --> 00:01:57.771
Once you confirm, Claude will ask your

63
00:01:57.806 --> 00:01:58.108
name.

64
00:01:58.398 --> 00:01:59.652
Type it in and hit Continue.

65
00:01:59.942 --> 00:02:00.453
That's it.

66
00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:02.415
You now have a Claude account.

67
00:02:02.415 --> 00:02:03.831
You're now looking at Claude's chat

68
00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:04.563
interface.

69
00:02:04.969 --> 00:02:07.477
It's a simple screen: a big text box at

70
00:02:07.512 --> 00:02:09.276
the bottom where you type your message,

71
00:02:09.532 --> 00:02:11.273
and the conversation appears above it.

72
00:02:11.912 --> 00:02:13.665
This is where all the magic happens.

73
00:02:13.955 --> 00:02:15.407
Let's send your first message.

74
00:02:15.813 --> 00:02:17.543
Click in that text box and type something

75
00:02:17.601 --> 00:02:20.330
simple — try this: 'Hi Claude, I'm

76
00:02:20.376 --> 00:02:21.746
learning to build websites.

77
00:02:22.152 --> 00:02:24.811
Can you help me?' Then press Enter or

78
00:02:24.869 --> 00:02:25.891
click the send button.

79
00:02:26.529 --> 00:02:27.934
Claude will think for a second, then

80
00:02:27.992 --> 00:02:28.538
reply.

81
00:02:28.944 --> 00:02:29.908
Read the response.

82
00:02:30.453 --> 00:02:32.148
Claude is friendly and ready to help.

83
00:02:32.555 --> 00:02:34.888
Congratulations — you just had your first

84
00:02:34.935 --> 00:02:36.607
conversation with an AI that will help you

85
00:02:36.665 --> 00:02:37.721
build real projects.

86
00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:39.614
This is your launchpad.

87
00:02:39.614 --> 00:02:40.485
Let's recap.

88
00:02:40.775 --> 00:02:42.853
You went to claude dot ai, signed up with

89
00:02:42.911 --> 00:02:45.616
Google, email, or phone, confirmed your

90
00:02:45.651 --> 00:02:47.416
account, and landed in the chat.

91
00:02:47.962 --> 00:02:50.156
You sent Claude a message and got a reply.

92
00:02:50.504 --> 00:02:51.851
You're now set up and ready to start

93
00:02:51.897 --> 00:02:52.362
building.

94
00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.637
In the next lesson, we'll explore what

95
00:02:54.683 --> 00:02:56.553
Claude can actually do — you'll see

96
00:02:56.599 --> 00:02:58.608
Artifacts in action, which is how Claude

97
00:02:58.642 --> 00:03:00.860
builds live, interactive pages right in

98
00:03:00.895 --> 00:03:01.510
your browser.

99
00:03:02.149 --> 00:03:04.459
But first, complete today's exercise.

100
00:03:04.459 --> 00:03:06.862
Your exercise: send Claude a message

101
00:03:06.909 --> 00:03:08.464
introducing yourself and what you want to

102
00:03:08.522 --> 00:03:08.952
learn.

103
00:03:09.498 --> 00:03:11.274
Then take a screenshot of Claude's reply

104
00:03:11.332 --> 00:03:13.584
and save it — that's your proof you

105
00:03:13.642 --> 00:03:14.734
completed lesson one.

106
00:03:15.372 --> 00:03:18.368
Next up: we'll see Claude build a real,

107
00:03:18.403 --> 00:03:20.585
working page in seconds using Artifacts.

108
00:03:21.328 --> 00:03:22.153
See you there.
